<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 45 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 45 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 45 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated July 8, and repaid maturing paper totalling 33.7 million dinars.</p>
<p>Herewith breakdown of the results:</p>
<p>		  Maturity    Amount	Rate	  Previous  rate</p>
<p>   Two-year notes	   45 MD	7.00		 6.9375</p>
<p>Banks bid for 142 million dinars for two-year paper at between 7.00 and 7.3125 percent. ($=1.1090 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
